dplyr::filter(data, 'ready' == status)
NEW:
====
dplyr::filter(data, status == 'ready')

OLD:
====
(1) + 1 == x + 1
1 == -x
1 == x * 2
1 == (x > y)
NEW:
====
x + 1 == (1) + 1
-x == 1
x * 2 == 1
(x > y) == 1

OLD:
====
1 == !x
1 == x + !y
1 == -!x
1 == if (flag) x else y
1 == function(x) x
NEW:
====
(!x) == 1
(x + !y) == 1
(-!x) == 1
(if (flag) x else y) == 1
(function(x) x) == 1

